  {
   "slug": "rooms-gallery",
   "title": "Room by Room",
   "template": "page-wide",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>A selection of rooms from recent projects, gathered by space. Click a room to read the full story.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Living rooms</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"columns\":3,\"linkTo\":\"none\",\"align\":\"wide\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-3 is-cropped alignwide\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:living}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:living}}\" alt=\"Living room with a linen sofa\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:living}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:nook}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:nook}}\" alt=\"Reading nook under the stairs\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:nook}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:dining}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:dining}}\" alt=\"Dining corner with a round table\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:dining}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --></figure><!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Kitchens</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"columns\":2,\"linkTo\":\"none\",\"align\":\"wide\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-2 is-cropped alignwide\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:kitchen-after}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:kitchen-after}}\" alt=\"Galley kitchen with an oak counter\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:kitchen-after}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:shelves}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:shelves}}\" alt=\"Open oak shelves\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:shelves}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --></figure><!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Bedrooms &amp; bathrooms</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"columns\":3,\"linkTo\":\"none\",\"align\":\"wide\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-3 is-cropped alignwide\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:bedroom}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:bedroom}}\" alt=\"Bedroom in layered linen\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:bedroom}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:bath-after}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:bath-after}}\" alt=\"Pink plaster bathroom\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:bath-after}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:moodboard}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:moodboard}}\" alt=\"Material samples and moodboard\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:moodboard}}\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --></figure><!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:contact}}\">Start a project</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons -->",
   "excerpt": "A gallery of recent rooms from the studio."
  },
  {
   "slug": "services",
   "title": "Services",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Every home is different, so our services are flexible. Most clients start with a consultation and decide from there.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"className\":\"services\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide services\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"num\"} --><p class=\"num\">01</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Consultation</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Two hours at your home. You receive a written plan, palette and shopping list within a week.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"num\"} --><p class=\"num\">02</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Room design</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Concept, moodboard, layout drawings and a full sourcing list for one room.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"num\"} --><p class=\"num\">03</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Full renovation</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Design, trades, budget and timeline, managed from start to finish.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:moodboard}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:moodboard}}\" alt=\"A moodboard with fabric, wood and paint samples\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:moodboard}}\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Every project starts with a moodboard of real materials.</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">How it works</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} --><ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>A short call to understand the space and the budget.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>A visit to measure, photograph and listen.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>A concept presentation with materials you can touch.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Ordering, building and styling.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ol><!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons --><div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button --><div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link wp-element-button\" href=\"{{page:contact}}\">Book a consultation</a></div><!-- /wp:button --></div><!-- /wp:buttons -->"
  },
  {
   "slug": "about",
   "title": "About the Studio",
   "content": "<!-- wp:media-text {\"mediaId\":{{media_id:moodboard}},\"mediaType\":\"image\"} --><div class=\"wp-block-media-text is-stacked-on-mobile\"><figure class=\"wp-block-media-text__media\"><img src=\"{{media:moodboard}}\" alt=\"A moodboard with fabric and wood samples\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:moodboard}} size-full\"/></figure><div class=\"wp-block-media-text__content\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"className\":\"kicker\"} --><p class=\"kicker\">About the studio</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Quiet rooms, made by hand</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Nest &amp; Nook is a small interior design studio of three designers and a dog. We design calm, practical homes using natural materials, local makers and as much of what you already own as possible.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div></div><!-- /wp:media-text -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What we believe</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Light first, furniture second.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Fewer, better things.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Natural materials that age well.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>A home is never finished, and that is fine.</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We would rather reupholster your grandmother&rsquo;s chair than sell you a new one.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>The studio</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote -->"
  },
  {
   "slug": "contact",
   "title": "Contact",
   "parent": "about",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Tell us about your home: the room, what is not working and what you dream it could be. We reply to every enquiry within three working days.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Studio</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Atelier 4, The Old Mill<br>By appointment only</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Email</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"mailto:studio@example.com\">studio@example.com</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Press</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>For images and features, write to us with the project you are interested in.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns -->"
  }
 ],
