   ],
   "featured_media": "living",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The brief for this Victorian terrace was simple: a living room that feels like an exhale. The owners work from home, so the room needed to separate the end of the day from everything before it.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We started by removing rather than adding. Two bulky cabinets went, the curtains came down, and the walls went from grey-blue to a warm oat white that changes with the light.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The palette</h2><!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:list --><ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Walls in warm oat, ceiling a shade lighter</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Pale oak for the coffee table and shelving</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Undyed linen, bouclé and wool for texture</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>A single deep olive accent in the armchair</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list -->\n\n<!-- wp:gallery {\"columns\":3,\"linkTo\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-3 is-cropped\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:living}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:living}}\" alt=\"A calm living room with a linen sofa and oak table\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:living}}\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">The sofa now faces the fireplace, not the television.</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:shelves}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:shelves}}\" alt=\"Oak shelves styled with ceramics and books\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:shelves}}\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Shelves styled in groups of three.</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"id\":{{media_id:dining}},\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:dining}}\" alt=\"A dining corner with a round table\" class=\"wp-image-{{media_id:dining}}\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">The corner dining table borrows light from the bay window.</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --></figure><!-- /wp:gallery -->\n\n<!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Calm rooms are not empty rooms. They are rooms where everything has a reason.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>From our studio notes</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"className\":\"shop-look\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\"}} --><div class=\"wp-block-group shop-look\"><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Living room</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list {\"className\":\"shop-list\"} --><ul class=\"wp-block-list shop-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li><span>Linen sofa, three seat<em>Natural, deep seat</em></span><span class=\"price\">&euro;1,890</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><span>Round oak coffee table<em>Oiled, 90 cm</em></span><span class=\"price\">&euro;640</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><span>Bouclé armchair<em>Olive</em></span><span class=\"price\">&euro;720</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><span>Paper floor lamp<em>Rice paper shade</em></span><span class=\"price\">&euro;210</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li><span>Wool rug<em>Undyed, 200 &times; 300</em></span><span class=\"price\">&euro;480</span></li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ul><!-- /wp:list --></div><!-- /wp:group -->",
   "comments": [
